1228
01:56:07.454 --> 01:56:13.014
your observations and how to pass them on
through your school's agreed process. A

1229
01:56:13.015 --> 01:56:18.366
short note about what happened, what
preceded it and what helped can make that

1230
01:56:18.367 --> 01:56:23.719
conversation specific. We'll develop
